{"version":1,"content":"<p>一項最新分析顯示，在任何一個夜晚，平均每時每刻都有超過700顆衞星飛過一座中緯度城鎮的上空。在許多地區，這一數量已經超過人們用肉眼能夠看到的星星，標誌着人造衞星正在深刻改變人類仰望夜空的方式。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587140.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:40:46.166388+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T16:29:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T16:33:54.133747+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:33:54.133747+00:00","content_hash":"5d2a55d2c43af61825bb0f0321b5f6bf1f1dd9c966d296900a5eca8b0a2b0469","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}